UPDATE companies SET description='Powerex Inc is based in Youngwood, Pennsylvania, where it designs and manufactures high-power semiconductor solutions. The company''s founding date and ownership details are not specified in available sources.

The company manufactures a broad portfolio of high-power semiconductor devices, including insulated-gate bipolar transistors (IGBTs), high-voltage IGBTs (HVIGBTs), silicon carbide (SiC) modules and discretes, thyristor and diode modules ranging from 600 V to 11,000 V, and discrete rectifiers and thyristors in disc and stud packages. It also produces custom power modules and integrated power product assemblies, and operates reliability testing and analytical capabilities. The product line includes traction rectifiers for railway applications, with over 8,000 units noted in company communications.

Powerex serves military and aerospace power converter programs and medical imaging amplifier manufacturers. Its traction rectifiers are used in railway systems, converting AC to DC power using silicon diodes and aluminum heat sinks.

The company emphasizes custom module design, offering prototypes and drop-in replacements with validation and qualification support. It has introduced a line of SiC power modules with blocking voltages from 650 V to 10,000 V, aimed at higher power density applications. Flexible online ordering options are also highlighted.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["IGBT and HVIGBT manufacturing", "Silicon Carbide (SiC) module and discrete production", "Thyristor and diode module manufacturing (600 V\u201311,000 V)", "Discrete rectifier and thyristor production (disc and stud packages)", "Custom power module design and prototyping", "Integrated power product assembly", "Reliability testing and analytical services", "Traction rectifier assembly"], "industries": ["Military and aerospace power converters", "Medical imaging amplifiers", "Railway traction"], "materials": ["Silicon", "Silicon Carbide (SiC)", "Aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom module design for any package size or drop-in replacement", "Silicon Carbide (SiC) modules with blocking voltages up to 10,000 V", "Reliability testing and analytical capabilities", "Flexible online ordering options"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Youngwood, Pennsylvania -> db", "Certification: ISO9001 -> db", "Industries served: Military & Aerospace power converters, Medical imaging amplifiers -> db", "Products: IGBTs, HVIGBTs, SiC modules, thyristor/diode modules, discrete rectifiers/thyristors, custom modules, traction rectifiers -> /", "Capabilities: Reliability Testing & Analytical Capabilities -> db", "Custom module design for any package size -> /", "SiC modules with blocking voltages 650V\u201310,000V -> /", "Over 8,000 traction rectifiers -> /", "Flexible online ordering options -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Powerex - Complete range of IGBTs and HVIGBTs and other Integrated High P