UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Circuits, headquartered in Downers Grove, Illinois, was founded in 2001 as an employee-owned enterprise. The company began with a focus on delivering total electronics solutions to the specialty vehicle market, leveraging in-house design and manufacturing capabilities.

The firm designs, manufactures, and assembles custom electronic products, including battery disconnects, isolation managers, touch-screen displays, multiplex systems, battery control centers, 120 V distribution panels, power control systems, switch panels, tank-level sensors, LCD controls, wireless LIN modules, HVAC control modules, water-pump controllers, and associated wiring harnesses. Operations span product development, firmware programming, mechanical design, and final assembly, serving both OEM and aftermarket channels.

Precision Circuits serves the specialty vehicle sector, with a strong presence in recreational vehicles (RVs) and commercial vehicle upfits. Its customer roster includes major RV builders such as Airstream, Winnebago, Forest River, Jayco, Tiffin Motorhomes, and Grand Design, as well as commercial upfitters like Knapheide and Utilimaster. The company also supports solar-energy integrators such as Solar Energy Systems LLC and Dragonfly Energy.

The company attributes its differentiation to its employee-ownership model, which it says fosters a more engaged workforce, and to its deep knowledge of specialty vehicle electrical systems. A stated commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction underpins its mission to be the provider of total electronics solutions for the specialty vehicle industry.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom electronics design", "Electronic manufacturing", "Assembly", "Firmware programming", "Product design", "Application engineering", "Mechanical design", "Technical support"], "industries": ["Specialty vehicle", "Recreational vehicle (RV)", "Commercial vehicle", "Solar energy"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Employee-owned structure driving engagement", "Made in the USA manufacturing", "Specialized expertise in specialty vehicle electrical systems", "Full-service design, manufacture, and assembly of custom electronics", "Over 22 years of quality and customer service commitment"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2001 -> db", "Headquarters Downers Grove, Illinois -> db", "Employee-owned -> homepage, about-us", "Products list -> homepage", "Industries served: specialty vehicle, RV, commercial vehicle, solar -> homepage, about-us", "Customer examples -> homepage", "Leadership team -> about-us", "Mission statement -> homepage", "Differentiators: employee ownership, made in USA, deep knowledge -> homepage, about-us", "Capabilities: design, manufacture, assembly, programming, mechanical design -> about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We design, manufacture, and assemble custom electronics.", "founded_year": "2001", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Employee-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='precision-circuits' AND approved AN