UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Technical Molding was founded in 2016 in Green Valley, Arizona, beginning with a single injection molding machine. The company operates under the PTM/Grupo Selagon group, maintaining a U.S. warehouse in Nogales, Arizona, and a manufacturing facility in Cibuta, Sonora, Mexico.

