UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Wire Technologies operates from Fort Wayne, Indiana, where it has been drawing fine and ultra-fine wire for nearly 30 years. The company began as a specialist in fine wire drawing and has since expanded into resistance wire manufacturing and custom drawing services. No founding year or ownership structure is disclosed in public materials.

