UPDATE companies SET description='Pro-Fab Sheet Metal Inc was founded in 1996 in Addison, Illinois, and has grown across two generations into a multi-plant operation. The company maintains its headquarters in Addison and operates additional manufacturing facilities in Crown Point, Indiana, and Indianapolis, Indiana.

