UPDATE companies SET description='Provideon Wire & Cable was founded in 2022 in Washington, Pennsylvania, by the former president of a third-generation Western Pennsylvania wire company. The founder drew on 30 years of industry experience and a family legacy passed down from his father and grandfathers to establish the business on principles of quality and service.

