UPDATE companies SET description='Pure Power Solar is based in Louisville, Kentucky. Founded in 2017 by Nicholas Hartnett, a Louisville native and University of Kentucky alumnus who returned from a solar sales career in Southern California to start the company. He aimed to create an honest, reputable solar installer in a market he felt was plagued by deceptive tactics.

The company designs and installs solar photovoltaic systems and battery storage for residential and commercial customers. All work is performed by an in-house crew without subcontractors, covering design, permitting, grid interconnection, and monitoring setup. They are authorized installers for Tesla, SolarEdge, and EG4 equipment.

Pure Power Solar serves homeowners, businesses, nonprofits, churches, and municipal governments in the Louisville area and surrounding Kentucky communities. The company has been selected for multiple Solarize campaigns, including Solarize Louisville (2024, 2025, 2026), Solarize Boyle (2025), and Solarize Frankfort (2023, 2024), reflecting its role in community-driven clean energy programs.

Hartnett founded the business to counter what he saw as deceptive sales practices and fly-by-night installers. The company emphasizes full control over every installation step, a no-subcontractor policy, and a commitment to ethical sales without high-pressure tactics. It maintains an A+ Better Business Bureau rating and five-star Google reviews across its project history.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar PV system design and installation", "Battery energy storage system installation", "Permitting and inspection management", "Net metering application and approval", "System monitoring portal setup", "Post-installation service and maintenance", "Solar tax incentive and financing consultation"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Nonprofit organizations", "Religious institutions", "Municipal government"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Tesla Powerwall", "SolarEdge inverters", "EG4 batteries"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house installation crew with no subcontractors", "NABCEP-certified solar professionals", "Authorized installer for Tesla, SolarEdge, and EG4", "A+ BBB rating and 5-star Google reviews", "Ethical sales practices with no high-pressure tactics"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2017 by Nicholas Hartnett -> /about", "Headquartered in Louisville, Kentucky -> db", "NABCEP-certified solar professionals -> /", "Selected for Solarize Louisville 2024, 2025, 2026; Solarize Boyle 2025; Solarize Frankfort 2023, 2024 -> /", "Authorized installers of Tesla, SolarEdge, and EG4 -> /", "Over 500 installations completed -> /about", "A+ BBB rating and 5-star Google reviews -> /about", "In-house crew, no subcontractors -> /about", "Licenses: CE License, Louisville GC License, Louisville Electrical License -> /about", "Team includes family members and veterans -> /about", "Serves businesses, nonprofits, churches, municipalities -> /", "Offers solar tax incentives and financing via Direct P